        ("ontology", "/ɑːnˈtɑː.lə.dʒi/", "noun", "C1", "Bản thể luận triết học", "The branch of metaphysics dealing with the nature of being.", ["Ontology explores fundamental questions about what it means to exist."], ["theory of existence"], ["philosophical ontology", "study ontology"]),
