        ("unconscious", "/ʌnˈkɑːn.ʃəs/", "noun", "B1", "Tầng tiềm thức / vô thức", "The part of the mind which is inaccessible to the conscious mind.", ["Dreams reveal the hidden symbolic desires of the human unconscious."], ["subconscious", "psyche"], ["collective unconscious", "human unconscious"]),
